            <div class="kv"><dt>概要</dt><dd>出荷実績入力用のCSVを出力できる</dd></div>
          </dl>
          <div class="doc-flow">
            <h3 class="doc-h doc-h-section" style="--lv:0">出荷実績入力用CSV出力項目設定</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="item-table-wrap">
            <table class="item-table">
              <thead>
                <tr><th>識別ID</th><th>項目名</th><th>備考</th></tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                <tr><td>1</td><td>注文番号</td><td></td></tr>
                <tr><td>2</td><td>会員ID</td><td></td></tr>
                <tr><td>3</td><td>お名前(姓)</td><td></td></tr>
                <tr><td>4</td><td>お名前(名)</td><td></td></tr>
                <tr><td>5</td><td>お名前(セイ)</td><td></td></tr>
